      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "About avatars the quest can’t see it because it doesn’t have enough computing power to load it. So the client forcing it to load a poor performing model made for computer is an impossible feat. About the rank it’s self. There isn’t much point. Many people who have been playing for a year or two now will have had met these requirements making every trusted user become this premium user. Tho only ones who wouldn’t get it would be those who haven’t hit trusted yet more or less.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
