      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That is a hard no. I am shocked that someone would want to give power to a higher rank. This is a social game, not a competition. The current rank system has good intentions but has been a horrible implementation. We do not need to cause more harm by empowering those with a higher rank anymore than there already is.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
