        "like": 12
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Big nope from me. User ranks were an awful idea to begin with. People use them now only to prevent lag while other people are trying to be elitist with their rank even though it basically means nothing. In one of the beta builds they tried having a higher rank than Trusted User and it went very poorly as people started reporting and blocking others to knock people out of the rank.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
