      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If there would be a Premium rank it shouldn't be a user rank/trust rank but rather a normal premium rank thing. It should be an extension to the nameplate to not mess with the trust rank system. I like the idea of having 36 slots for favorite avatars but it should aslo have some other things. Idk what other things a premium rank could have because there arent really any limitations that are annoying.\n\nPS: The idea that quest users could see the avatar even if it was poor performance is really bad. Quest blocks poor avatars for a reason. Theres no denying it. even if its just 1 player with a poor avatar that would still make quest users loose performance",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
